WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:14.688
Hello!

2
00:00:14.689 --> 00:00:17.837
Hello!

3
00:00:17.838 --> 00:00:20.940
Who are you?

4
00:00:20.941 --> 00:00:24.712
I'm a bottlenose dolphin.

5
00:00:24.713 --> 00:00:28.345
Dolphins are mammals.

6
00:00:28.346 --> 00:00:33.483
We're also very smart.

7
00:00:33.484 --> 00:00:35.949
Where do you live?

8
00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:39.836
We live all over the world.

9
00:00:39.837 --> 00:00:44.494
We like tropical oceans.

10
00:00:44.495 --> 00:00:47.976
Can you breathe underwater?

11
00:00:47.977 --> 00:00:53.135
No. We come up often for air.

12
00:00:53.136 --> 00:00:58.509
We breathe through our blowholes.

13
00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:01.393
What do you eat?

14
00:01:01.394 --> 00:01:04.757
We eat lots of fish.

15
00:01:04.758 --> 00:01:10.152
We also like squid and crabs.

16
00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:13.334
Do you live alone?

17
00:01:13.335 --> 00:01:18.961
No. Bottlenose dolphins live in big groups.

18
00:01:18.962 --> 00:01:22.896
These groups are called pods.

19
00:01:22.897 --> 00:01:27.332
Wow! You can jump out of the water!

20
00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:31.186
Dolphins can jump very high.

21
00:01:31.187 --> 00:01:34.133
And then . . .

22
00:01:34.134 --> 00:01:40.833
Splash!

23
00:01:40.834 --> 00:01:43.823
Do you have any enemies?

24
00:01:43.824 --> 00:01:47.847
Large sharks sometimes attack us.

25
00:01:47.848 --> 00:01:51.443
So do killer whales.

26
00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:58.424
We can get caught in fishing nets too.

27
00:01:58.425 --> 00:02:01.115
I see my pod.

28
00:02:01.116 --> 00:02:04.039
Good-bye!

29
00:02:04.040 --> 00:02:10.134
Bye, Bottlenose Dolphin!
